abstract: >-
  Analysis code and the trained model accompanying the manuscript "An interpretable
  algorithmic risk prediction model for postpartum hemorrhage prior to delivery using
  antepartum features in vaginal delivery: a retrospective cohort study", submitted to
  BMC Medical Informatics and Decision Making (2026).
